  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tCapium Hub\n\t\tCapium Hub Overview\n\n### How to approve Docscan receipts\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Fri, 23 Jul, 2021 at 11:44 AM\n\n\t\tLocation:\n\nPurchases >> Docscan >> Find the transaction >> Using the drop down box select 'Record' >> Select nominal ledger >> Click on save and close. \n\nVideo Tutorial:\n\nClick here to watch how to approve a scanned receipt \n\nHelp Guide:\n\nFrom the client dashboard, go into 'Purchases' and then 'Docscan'. \n\nUse the search function to find the scanned receipts. \n\nFind the transaction and using the drop down box, click on 'Record'.\n\nThe system will automatically enter the amount of the receipt onto the invoice as well as attach the scanned receipt. \n\nThe final step is to select the nominal account to post this transaction into and click on 'Save & Close'.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000117301\">Capium Hub</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000195363\">Capium Hub Overview</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">How to approve Docscan receipts\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Fri, 23 Jul, 2021 at 11:44 AM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong><u dir=\"ltr\">Location:</u></strong></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Purchases &gt;&gt; Docscan &gt;&gt; Find the transaction &gt;&gt; Using the drop down box select 'Record' &gt;&gt; Select nominal ledger &gt;&gt; Click on save and close.&nbsp;</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><strong><u dir=\"ltr\">Video Tutorial:</u></strong></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><a href=\"https://www.loom.com/share/5a78bea847024b6293c452717ad7bb21\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Click here to watch how to approve a scanned receipt</a>&nbsp;</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><strong><u>Help Guide:</u></strong></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">From the client dashboard, go into 'Purchases' and then 'Docscan'.&nbsp;</p><p dir=\"ltr\">Use the search function to find the scanned receipts.&nbsp;</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9135110320/original/jSalCIy57a_ypDJ3hyAyevPEO_N0oPmxdg.png?1626880519\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9135110320\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Find the transaction and using the drop down box, click on 'Record'.</p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9135110445/original/X2QpN4qcqDr7VEXH_0QbJ7ENHNX2fdnnKQ.png?1626880557\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9135110445\"></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">The system will automatically enter the amount of the receipt onto the invoice as well as attach the scanned receipt.&nbsp;</p><p dir=\"ltr\">The final step is to select the nominal account to post this transaction into and click on 'Save &amp; Close'.</p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9135111851/original/BJSHjdl1CcmqmCwyvln-Mxf2txXRYx9TYQ.png?1626881202\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9135111851\"></p><p><br></p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000204678\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000204678/thumbs_up\" class=\"vote-up a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_up\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000204678\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-update-with-message=\"Glad we could be helpful. Thanks for the feedback.\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes</span><span class=\"vote-down-container\"><span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000204678/thumbs_down\" class=\"vote-down a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_down\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t